cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ProteinLab in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "ProteinLab: structure-derived transmembrane topology annotation and interactive visualization of membrane proteins"
abstract: >-
  ProteinLab derives a residue-level, side-resolved transmembrane topology directly
  from atomic coordinates. An implicit-membrane transfer-energy model places the
  bilayer, a consensus annotation engine merges the topology with an independent
  secondary-structure assignment on a shared residue frame, and the result is
  presented as an interactive, publication-quality figure with machine-readable
  export.
type: software
